{"id":"chetyre","lemma":"четыре","pos":"num","rank":354,"glosses":["four (4)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a6/Ru-%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%8B%D1%80%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%8B%D1%80%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"У моей матери четыре брата.","en":"My mother has four brothers.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"mother","l":"мать"},null,{"g":"brother","l":"брат"}]},{"text":"В этом городе четыре школы.","en":"There are four schools in this town.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,null,null,{"g":"school","l":"школа"}]},{"text":"Мой отец умер четыре года назад.","en":"My father died four years ago.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"},{"g":"back"}]},{"text":"Мы хотим номер на четыре ночи.","en":"We want a room for four nights.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"nominal number"},{"g":"on / at"},null,{"g":"night, nighttime","l":"ночь"}]},{"text":"Его мать умерла через четыре года.","en":"His mother died four years later.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"},{"g":"through"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"}]}]}